      "writtenOn": "2024-10-15T02:08:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think we should ignore `SCAN_MODE_OPPORTUNISTIC`. Per definition:\n\u003e A special Bluetooth LE scan mode. Applications using this scan mode will passively listen for other scan results without starting BLE scans themselves.\n\n```suggestion\n                    !mRegularScanClients.stream().anyMatch(c -\u003e c.started \u0026\u0026 c.filters.isEmpty() \u0026\u0026 !(client.settings !\u003d null \u0026\u0026 client.settings.getScanMode() !\u003d ScanSettings.SCAN_MODE_OPPORTUNISTIC));\n```",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 2032,
        "startChar": 59,
        "endLine": 2032,
        "endChar": 96
      },
      "revId": "e438b90db3283db14f8747ea63cb44f503535eb7",
